" taskman v0.0.0              │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"▾ usr                        │                                    Welcome to taskman                                    "
" ─────────────────────────── │                                                                                          "
"   no tickets · ^a n         │               Press ctrl+a n to add an agent (or a ticket, with a tracker).              "
"                             │    Connect a tracker (Jira, Linear, GitHub Issues or Local files) for tickets, each in   "
"                             │                     its own worktree with its issue and PR beside it.                    "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                   ╭ Add ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮                   "
"                   │                                                                                │                   "
"                   │  Project  ‹ usr ›                                                              │                   "
"                   │           ←/→ to change                                                        │                   "
"                   │  Type     ‹ Agent ›                                                            │                   "
"                   │           a ticket's session, or an agent with no ticket                       │                   "
"                   │  CLI      ‹ Claude ›                                                           │                   "
"                   │           the coding CLI the session runs                                      │                   "
"                   │  Role                                                                          │                   "
"                   │           optional: a standing instruction for its brief, e.g. review PRs      │                   "
"                   │  Name                                                                          │                   "
"                   │           an agent's name, e.g. oss-planner; ←/→ on Type for a ticket          │                   "
"                   │                                                                                │                   "
"                   │                                                                                │                   "
"                   │  Enter save   Tab next field   ←/→ change choice   ctrl+u clear   Esc cancel   │                   "
"                   │                                                                                │                   "
"                   ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯                   "
